T1  - A Taxonomy of Generative Artificial Intelligence in Health Economics and Outcomes Research: An ISPOR Working Group Report
AU  - Fleurence, Rachael L.
AU  - Wang, Xiaoyan
AU  - Bian, Jiang
AU  - Higashi, Mitchell K.
AU  - Ayer, Turgay
AU  - Xu, Hua
AU  - Dawoud, Dalia
