T1  - Accurate prediction of the kinetic sequence of physicochemical states using generative artificial intelligence††Electronic supplementary information (ESI) available. See DOI: https://doi.org/10.1039/d5sc00108k
AU  - Bera, Palash
AU  - Mondal, Jagannath
JO  - Chemical Science
VL  - 16
IS  - 20
SP  - 8735
EP  - 8751
PY  - 2025
